;UFNTER:  ENTER OPCODE (D/E/F/P/S/Q... ):$
*T ==> "thin1" is used to thin (resample at lower resolution) 1d Ufile data.
*T     different subregions can be resampled at different rates
*T     sampling can be with or without averaging of neighbouring points.
;UFNTER:  ENTER OPCODE (D/E/F/P/S/Q... ):$
F S VSF Q
